# Second class change (SecondClassChange): a level 40 human Wizard holding the marks of Scholar,
# Trust and Magus. Hannavalt, who changes only fighters, turns it away; Grand Magister Jurek opens
# the nuker mystics' pages and makes it a Sorcerer: the marks taken, fifteen C-grade coupons
# given, the fanfare, the class change's animation and message, and the congratulation page,
# whose page family the Sorcerer's parent class decides. After a relog Jurek says it has already
# made its second change. Expectations are the reference trace's (SecondClassChange.onTalk,
# onAdvEvent, getClassHtml).
